    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899460/extras/0c9cf62ac5d3a565e453b6fd87b77ac4.poster.avif?t=1746758656\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899460/extras/0c9cf62ac5d3a565e453b6fd87b77ac4.webm?t=1746758656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899460/extras/0c9cf62ac5d3a565e453b6fd87b77ac4.mp4?t=1746758656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>A long time ago, there was a magician king capable of mastering the four elements and maintaining peace. However, after his death, a Demon conquered the forests, ensuring that no one could leave the village and return alive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, a young man named Nagari decides to venture into the forest to find the wand and diary of the last king magician, seeking wisdom to free his people from the evil. The Diary appears to be a bridge between Nagari and other elements worlds that allows him to travel and master the ability of each place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899460/extras/675b45c315aec8f42ce0b66e1706e0ad.poster.avif?t=1746758656\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899460/extras/675b45c315aec8f42ce0b66e1706e0ad.webm?t=1746758656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899460/extras/675b45c315aec8f42ce0b66e1706e0ad.mp4?t=1746758656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Now, Nagari must master the forces of fire, water, earth, and air by traveling to every magic world to gain the ability and defeat monsters along his journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Engage in a variety of unique puzzles and challenges in order to advance through your adventure.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899460/extras/0c9cf62ac5d3a565e453b6fd87b77ac4.poster.avif?t=1746758656\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899460/extras/0c9cf62ac5d3a565e453b6fd87b77ac4.webm?t=1746758656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899460/extras/0c9cf62ac5d3a565e453b6fd87b77ac4.mp4?t=1746758656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>A long time ago, there was a magician king capable of mastering the four elements and maintaining peace. However, after his death, a Demon conquered the forests, ensuring that no one could leave the village and return alive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, a young man named Nagari decides to venture into the forest to find the wand and diary of the last king magician, seeking wisdom to free his people from the evil. The Diary appears to be a bridge between Nagari and other elements worlds that allows him to travel and master the ability of each place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899460/extras/675b45c315aec8f42ce0b66e1706e0ad.poster.avif?t=1746758656\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899460/extras/675b45c315aec8f42ce0b66e1706e0ad.webm?t=1746758656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899460/extras/675b45c315aec8f42ce0b66e1706e0ad.mp4?t=1746758656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Now, Nagari must master the forces of fire, water, earth, and air by traveling to every magic world to gain the ability and defeat monsters along his journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Engage in a variety of unique puzzles and challenges in order to advance through your adventure.</p>",
